❗️The White House is preparing to unveil OVER $1 BILLION in industry commitments for its AI-driven Genesis Mission, according to Axios.

The mission aims to harness advanced AI to accelerate American scientific breakthroughs. AMD, OpenAI and Anthropic are among the companies involved. President Trump is expected to attend Thursday's AI science summit as Washington pushes to accelerate scientific discoveries amid federal research funding cuts.

