⚠️ For the first time in either presidency, Trump will present the National Medal of Science.

Elon Musk, Jensen Huang, Lisa Su and Sergey Brin will receive it Thursday at the White House's "Science: A New Golden Age" summit. Satya Nadella and Michael Dell will receive the separate National Medal of Technology and Innovation.

